{"id":"05d06211-58b6-437d-adcb-48a85b7a18b2","createdAt":"2026-10-26T12:11:37.469Z","batchId":"settings_qwen3-8-27b-gateway_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-27b-gateway","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div>\n      <h1>Account settings</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, notification preferences and privacy controls. Changes save to your account the moment you leave a field.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"row between gap-sm\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, rgba(0,0,0,.08)); padding-bottom:12px; margin-bottom:16px;\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"tablist\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-tab=\"profile\">Profile</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" data-tab=\"notifications\">Notifications</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" data-tab=\"privacy\">Privacy &amp; security</button>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Signed in as Maya</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- PROFILE -->\n      <section data-panel=\"profile\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:72px;height:72px;font-size:24px;\">ML</div>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n              <span class=\"stat-value\">Maya Lindqvist</span>\n              <span class=\"badge\">Active</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"muted small\">Member since March 2021 · Last sign-in 2 hours ago from Lisbon, PT</p>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Change avatar</button>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Remove</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr/>\n\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n          <label>Full name\n            <input type=\"text\" value=\"Maya Lindqvist\"/>\n          </label>\n          <label>Username\n            <input type=\"text\" value=\"mayalq\"/>\n          </label>\n          <label>Email address\n            <input type=\"email\" value=\"maya.lindqvist@example.com\"/>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">Used for sign-in and account recovery.</span>\n          </label>\n          <label>Timezone\n            <select>\n              <option selected>(UTC+01:00) Lisbon, Madrid</option>\n              <option>(UTC+00:00) London, Lisbon (winter)</option>\n              <option>(UTC−08:00) Pacific Time</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n          <label>Location\n            <input type=\"text\" value=\"Lisbon, PT\"/>\n          </label>\n          <label>Website\n            <input type=\"url\" value=\"https://mayalq.design\"/>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Bio</span>\n          <textarea rows=\"3\">Product designer focused on accessible data visualisations. Coffee enthusiast, always on the look-out for a good paper map.</textarea>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Shown on your public profile. Max 240 characters.</span>\n        </label>\n\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Profile is <b>public</b> — see Privacy &amp; security to change this.</span>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm\">Save profile</button>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- NOTIFICATIONS -->\n      <section data-panel=\"notifications\" hidden>\n        <h3>Email notifications</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Sent to maya.lindqvist@example.com. You can manage per-project settings from each project's menu.</p>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/> Security alerts <span class=\"badge badge-outline\" style=\"margin-left:6px;\">Recommended</span></label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/> Mentions and replies</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/> Comments on your work</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/> Weekly activity digest</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/> Product updates and tips</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/> Marketing and partner offers</label>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr/>\n\n        <h3>Push notifications</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Delivered to devices where you have push enabled. Currently enabled on 2 devices.</p>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/> Mentions and replies</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/> Comments on your work</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/> Daily digest</label>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr/>\n\n        <h3>Quiet hours</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Notifications are silenced during this window and delivered once it ends.</p>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n          <label>Enabled\n            <label class=\"check\" style=\"padding-top:10px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/></label>\n          </label>\n          <label>Start\n            <input type=\"time\" value=\"22:00\"/>\n          </label>\n          <label>End\n            <input type=\"time\" value=\"07:30\"/>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm\">Save preferences</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Turn all off</button>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- PRIVACY -->\n      <section data-panel=\"privacy\" hidden>\n        <h3>Profile visibility</h3>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n          <label>Who can see your profile\n            <select>\n              <option selected>Anyone</option>\n              <option>People I follow</option>\n              <option>Only me</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n          <label>Profile on search engines\n            <label class=\"check\" style=\"padding-top:10px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/></label>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/> Show my location on public profile</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/> Use my activity to personalise recommendations</label>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr/>\n\n        <h3>Security</h3>\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n              <span>Two-factor authentication</span>\n              <span class=\"badge\">Enabled</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">Authenticator app · last verified 4 days ago.</span>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Manage</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr/>\n\n        <h3>Active sessions</h3>\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>Device</th><th>Location</th><th>Last active</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>MacBook Pro · Safari</td>\n              <td>Lisbon, PT</td>\n              <td>Now</td>\n              <td><span class=\"badge\">Current</span></td>\n              <td></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>iPhone 14 · iOS app</td>\n              <td>Lisbon, PT</td>\n              <td>2 hours ago</td>\n              <td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Trusted</span></td>\n              <td><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Sign out</button></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Windows 11 · Chrome</td>\n              <td>Porto, PT</td>\n              <td>6 days ago</td>\n              <td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Trusted</span></td>\n              <td><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Sign out</button></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>iPad · Mobile web</td>\n              <td>Porto, PT</td>\n              <td>3 weeks ago</td>\n              <td><span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Untrusted</span></td>\n              <td><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-destructive\">Revoke</button></td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Sign out all other sessions</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr/>\n\n        <h3>Danger zone</h3>\n        <div class=\"alert\">\n          <div class=\"row between gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n            <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <b>Delete account</b>\n              <span class=\"muted small\">Permanently removes your profile, files and billing history. This cannot be undone.</span>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-destructive\">Delete…</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]');\n    const panels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');\n    buttons.forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const target = btn.dataset.tab;\n        buttons.forEach(b => {\n          b.classList.toggle('btn', b.dataset.tab === target);\n          b.classList.toggle('btn-secondary', b.dataset.tab !== target);\n        });\n        panels.forEach(p => {\n          p.hidden = p.dataset.panel !== target;\n        });\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</div>","deltas":[[8074,"\n\n<div"],[8084," class"],[8094,"=\""],[8094,"page"],[8105,"\">"],[8105,"\n"],[8122," "],[8122," "],[8231,"<div"],[8249," class"],[8249,"=\""],[8249,"stack"],[8249," gap"],[8249,"-lg"],[8249,"\">"],[8249,"\n"],[8249,"   "],[8249," "],[8249,"<div"],[8249,">"],[8249,"\n"],[8249,"     "],[8249," "],[8249,"<h"],[8261,"1"],[8276,">"],[8299,"Account"],[8331," settings"],[8363,"</h"],[8387,"1"],[8407,">"],[8431,"\n"],[8455,"     "],[8474," "],[8519,"<p class"],[8539,"=\""],[8561,"lead"],[8583,"\">"],[8604,"Manage"],[8625," your"],[8648," profile"],[8673,","],[8719," notification"],[8729," preferences"],[8738," and"],[8764," privacy"],[8784," controls"],[8801,"."],[8824," Changes"],[8856," save"],[8867," to"],[8890," your"],[8911," account"],[8933," the"],[8955," moment"],[8981," you"],[9004," leave"],[9023," a"],[9056," field"],[9064,"."],[9120,"</p>"],[9132,"\n"],[9155,"   "],[9173," "],[9200,"</div"],[9219,">"],[9240,"\n\n"],[9263,"   "],[9285," "],[9305,"<div"],[9334," class"],[9354,"=\""],[9372,"card"],[9401,"\">"],[9415,"\n"],[9440,"     "],[9463," "],[9487,"<div"],[9507," class"],[9525,"=\""],[9547,"row"],[9570," between"],[9591," gap"],[9613,"-sm"],[9641,"\""],[9664," style"],[9685,"=\""],[9710,"border"],[9739,"-bottom"],[9750,":"],[9786,"1"],[9796,"px"],[9812," solid"],[9835," var"],[9854,"(--"],[9878,"border"],[9901,","],[9924," rgba"],[9945,"("],[9965,"0"],[9986,","],[10008,"0"],[10030,","],[10056,"